        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: awards ceremony, Best Foreign Language Film selection, technical achievement awards\n- Works: Rudaali, Rambling Rose\n- People: Laura Dern\n- Topics: nominations, entries\n\nFacts:\n- At the awards ceremony, Rudaali was selected as an entry for the Best Foreign Language Film.\n- Rudaali was not accepted as a nominee for the Best Foreign Language Film.\n- At the same awards ceremony, Laura Dern presented the awards for technical achievements.\n- Laura Dern was nominated for Best Actress for Rambling Rose.",
